metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 136: the Gorogoro, Bianco Hills' rolling goop head (Petey's head under the stage's goop). Place it facing the way it should roll (its -Z... the body's heading is the node's yaw); give it a Graph (a Node3D whose children are the path's nodes, in order) or let it roll straight. The Bianco gatekeeper spits these by default. Knobs: Goop (the sheet / tint), Deviations (the death stamp, the trail, the speed), Effects, Sounds. RelaunchTicks 2500 = the game's GenerateInterval."

